+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 scope correction completed on current `origin/main` at `1a2b59ea91`. The ticket now records identity child-help enablement, 46 affected paths, the two omitted behavior contracts, all stale comment paths, and five focused verification commands. No code or documentation file has been edited. A fresh normal plan review is next.","timestamp":1787455746971770001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 fresh plan review passed and signed at `1a2b59ea91` with no blocking findings. The terminal-width advisory is accepted in scope. The generator will pin width and the held-out oracle will compare output under distinct `COLUMNS` values. The generated-artifact count does not justify splitting the coherent help-ownership change.","timestamp":1787457422586887001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 RED complete. The visible oracle failed six cases for missing intercept artifacts and disabled identity child help. The held-out oracle failed eight cases for missing artifacts, operation-path fallthrough, store initialization, and incomplete nested-family ownership. `config validate --help` passed as the control. Edge and end-to-end tests are held outside the implementation worktree at `/Users/joeoakhart/f12-heldout-oracle/oracle.py`.","timestamp":1787458217654120001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 resumed at current `origin/main`. The implementation worktree contains the completed 47-path change set. Scope reconciliation added `src/rebar/_cli/_audit_commands.py` because its ownership comment became inaccurate under the approved help model. The first fresh plan review ended before LLM execution when a concurrent ticket update caused an `origin/tickets` ref-lock race. A subsequent fetch completed, so the normal review can be retried without force. The implementation agent reported four TDD attempts.","timestamp":1787460184374856001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 passed its refreshed normal plan review after file impact expanded to 47 paths. The worktree is current with `origin/main`. Validation passes for both drift checks, 36 D3 tests, 221 D4 tests, nine held-out cases, lint, type checking across 639 files, whitespace, scope count, and the source-module line cap. The unrelated full suite was omitted by operator direction. F20 `alamode-greasy-jerboa` records inherited writing-guideline violations in generated CLI help without proposing mechanical enforcement. F12 is ready for commit and Gerrit.","timestamp":1787462542360842001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 CI investigation completed. Run 32620281081 failed the same three contract tests on Ubuntu Python 3.11, 3.12, 3.13, and macOS Python 3.13. Local reproduction matched. The root cause is stale downstream inventories after intercept help became discoverable. The ticket plan, file impact, and D6 verification now cover compatibility classification and structured output contracts. No source file has been edited. Next action is a fresh normal plan review.","timestamp":1787465127046688001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 CI remediation is implemented and validated. Compatibility help surfaces are categorized, `config`, `scan-spec`, and `sign-review` have registered schemas, offline advertisers are schema-validated, and four model operations have reason-bearing execution exemptions. D1, D2, D3 with 36 tests, D4 with 221 tests, D6 with 53 tests, lint, type checking across 640 files, plan currency, and commit ticket resolution passed. The branch is rebased onto `origin/main` at `4b6f0cfca40` with Change-Id `Ib7fd72bd55a52b4d2db31780f5c8158837357598`. Next action is Gerrit patchset push and gate wait.","timestamp":1787468790284304001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 CI completed successfully.\n\nCI_RESULT\n\n{\"run_id\":\"32624707092\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"duration\":1805,\"fixes_applied\":[],\"retry_count\":0}\n\nGerrit change 2148 is submittable at commit 131e75a16d88b26c02a715e213bd95f51b9d4b89. Verified is +1, LLM-Review is +1, and the unresolved comment count is zero. The change will be submitted next.","timestamp":1787470960399449001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F12 completed. Gerrit change 2148 merged as 131e75a16d88b26c02a715e213bd95f51b9d4b89 after LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and zero unresolved comments. The normal close transition performed bounded completion verification and moved immoderate-luxuriant-caiman from in_progress to closed without force.","timestamp":1787473908924393001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F19A resumed in /Users/joeoakhart/docs-f19a-config after a safe fast-forward to 131e75a16d88b26c02a715e213bd95f51b9d4b89. Its plan attestation remains certified and upstream did not touch its three file-impact paths. RED is confirmed. The visible exact CLI-exposure contract and the held-out unsupported-MCP-claim guard both failed for the intended reasons. The held-out oracle is outside the implementation worktree. No Gerrit run has started.","timestamp":1787474158260467001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F08A execution began in worktree docs-f08a-readme-current at origin/main 131e75a16d. The ticket is one README-only story with no descendants. Its F12 dependency is closed. Landing will use one Gerrit change after the documented Markdown and generated-documentation gates pass.","timestamp":1787474241247968001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F19A reached validated GREEN in /Users/joeoakhart/docs-f19a-config. RED showed both the visible exact-output contract and held-out unsupported-MCP guard failing for the intended reasons. The worker completed GREEN in one attempt. The generator check passed, 18 focused tests passed, the restored held-out assertions passed, lint passed, and git diff --check passed. The three modified paths match ticket file impact. The change is ready for commit and Gerrit when no other CI run is pending.","timestamp":1787474508284997001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F08A plan review passed at 131e75a16d with no blocking findings. One supported advisory identified that the targeted behavior checks were unnamed. D4 now names the focused claim, relation, unlink, help-routing, and work-ticket close contract suites. The dropped prerequisite finding was refuted by the existing depends_on link to closed F12. A refreshed normal plan review is next.","timestamp":1787474787487736001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F08A remediation review blocked because the plan named D1 through D4 without listing their commands. It also confirmed that close guidance must describe completion verification as optional and disabled by default. The revised plan now lists all four commands and names verify.require_completion_verification_for_close. No README edit has begun.","timestamp":1787475761225585001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F08A final plan review passed and signed at 131e75a16d. Mechanical README string checks were declined because the approved documentation policy prohibits mechanical prose enforcement. The plan records manual comparison against five named behavior suites. The minor compound-criterion advisory was accepted as a coherent documentation contract. Origin refresh and claim are next.","timestamp":1787476444771483001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F08A is claimed in progress after the signed plan review remained certified on refreshed origin/main at 131e75a16d. Repository editing may begin. No Gerrit push will occur until F19A CI reaches a terminal result.","timestamp":1787476555846976001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F08A implementation is committed as dbf351c3fea200c665e777bc3ba081ed3ebbc2b0 with Change-Id I5b560d76368b8c1ff49d8813d1e7c8be0772acca. The one-file README change passed D1 through D4 and the shared docs-only lane with 3158 tests and 15 skips. Generated-reference and documentation guards passed. Gerrit push is starting.","timestamp":1787477267659299001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"The shared current-session pointer selected another session log when the helper was used. Subsequent continuation entries target prosaic-radon-sardine directly. F19A CI run 32629125396 passed with no retry. Gerrit 2154 had both required votes and no unresolved comments, then merged at 2026-08-23 09:25:07 UTC. The first origin fetch did not yet contain commit 7e2e6afb27026969b86c922285390ba75aa5124b. F08A was released after the F19A run ended and is starting its Gerrit run.","timestamp":1787477290662532001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F10 preparation began in dedicated worktree /Users/joeoakhart/docs-f10-import at origin/main 7e2e6afb27. The historical decision and delivery record match current importer behavior. The current F10 plan remains accurate, has no ticket dependencies, and is stale only because F12 changed two reviewed files. A fresh normal plan review will run before claim or repository edits.","timestamp":1787477593587636001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F08A CI completed successfully.\n\nCI_RESULT\n\n{\"run_id\":\"32631071840\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"duration\":310,\"fixes_applied\":[],\"retry_count\":0}\n\nGerrit change 2155 has LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and zero unresolved comments. Submission is next.","timestamp":1787477660768766001}],"created_at":1787455736344090001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"090ebd88-57c2-409e-9c59-c5eb1cab142b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"65c9-aba3-c744-483a"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","65c9-aba3-c744-483a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3d23-26af-bc3f-476c","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Session log","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cdcf8e7a-3c41-4f2e-a583-d718cc83e634","48308715-3333-497b-aa4a-760ee69c7c67","b135d39b-27fd-476a-9677-b6de3d6c1bd1","6e2e43ce-36a3-41c9-988d-175c5bee27fb","c5031fde-726b-485a-b543-2f7a6ddbcee4","854d697e-1fc2-4028-ba